## Bounded contexts (do not mix)

| Context | Code paths | External system |
| ------- | ---------- | --------------- |
| **Platform / Identity** | `modules/auth`, `modules/account`, `modules/seller`, `modules/payer` | Internal DB; `infra/auth/` |
| **Receivables** | `modules/receivable/` | Internal DB only |
| **Ramp** | `modules/ramp/`; `infra/gateways/providers/etherfuse/` | Etherfuse FX API |
| **Registry** | `modules/registry/` (`domain/tradeBill/`); `infra/blockchain/stellar/`; `infra/gateways` → `RegistryGateway` | Soroban `TradeBillRegistry` |

Cross-context correlation: explicit IDs in DB or `compose/` callbacks only — no cross-module `domain/` imports.

